// row must already exist, matching a real deployment's own account-
// provisioning step) -- `raw_driver_seed` below stands in for that,
// same disclosed posture every other unbuilt-create-path table already
// uses. `NotifPrefs { digest: bool, quiet_hours: Option<String> }`
// (`domain_types.nir`) is flattened onto this row's own two fields
// (`digest`/`quiet_hours`), the same "flat screen projection, not the
// corpus struct verbatim" convention every row in this file follows.
